# Probe 302n (a baseline on the 301 tuple; CODEX-OPUS-AUTHOR-NAMED-MERGE-ASSIGN-DISCUSS-20261107-01): the author's
# names as written -- fn: test with c given a written default, called as test(merge(test\args; a: int: 5)).  test is a
# word of the language (the receiver test:): the translation refuses the binding of the name before any call is read.
fn: test (int: c 3; int: a) int
    return: c * 10 + a
end: test
int: code test(merge(test\args; a: int: 5))
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
